<title>USA: Hopkins Cty SDFC, Ky., won by JJB Hilliard.</title>
<headline>Hopkins Cty SDFC, Ky., won by JJB Hilliard.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>JJB Hillard, WL Lyons said it won $2.785 million of Hopkins Cty SDFC, Ky., school building revenue bonds, Series 1997, with a net interest cost of 5.25 percent. 538976288</p>
</text>
